# UI

- Whimsical light-first (+ soft dark); Fredoka + Nunito; Sage Garden tokens from `packages/ui` theme.
- **Web chrome:** shadcn/ui (Radix + Tailwind) is the preferred base for Button/input/dialog/toast — customize, don’t hand-roll duplicates. Game board (`LetterGrid`, path, tile drop, confetti) stays custom.
- `packages/ui` RN Button = Expo/RN path; web app chrome → shadcn once initialized. Don’t maintain two competing web Buttons.
- Mobile-first; minimize one-off Tailwind in routes.
- **Container queries = web-only.** Cross-platform layout: flex + max-width. No `@container` in pure RN views.
- UI changes require interactive verify (pointer swipe for play) — see `.cursor/skills/verify-ui`.
